DAY 27 — NETWORK MINI-PENTEST

OBJECTIVE:
Perform a network-focused pentest on an authorized lab target.

WORKFLOW:
Scope → Host Discovery → Port Scan → Service Enumeration → Vulnerability Identification → Validation → Evidence

HOST DISCOVERY:
nmap -sn <NETWORK/CIDR>

FULL PORT SCAN:
sudo nmap -p- <TARGET> -oA day27-full

SERVICE ENUMERATION:
sudo nmap -sC -sV -p <OPEN_PORTS> <TARGET> -oA day27-services

NSE:
nmap --script-help <script>
nmap --script <script> -p <PORT> <TARGET>

RECORD:

IP
Open ports
Service
Version
Possible vulnerability
Validation result
Evidence

METASPLOIT WORKFLOW:
Nmap finding → Confirm version → Search Metasploit → info → show options → Validate in lab

KEY RULE:
Open port ≠ vulnerability.
Service + version + confirmed weakness = finding.

EVIDENCE:
Save Nmap output and record commands, results, timestamps, and screenshots.
